===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|Индиꙗ}} and {{m|orv|Индѣꙗ}}. Judging by the initial stress, from {{der|ru|gmh|Indien}} or {{der|ru|zlw-opl|Indie}}, originally used alongside with {{cog|orv|Индикиꙗ}}. Ultimately, from {{der|ru|la|Indus}}, from {{der|ru|grc|Ἰνδός}}, from {{der|ru|sa|सिन्धु}}.

